**Special Containment Procedures:** Due to the recent discovery of SCP-7001, methods of containment are still under development. However, through the combined efforts of RAISA, Foundation Exclusionary Sites, and the Overseer Council, SCP-7001 can be reliably tracked via the use of amnestics. Efforts headed by the Overseer Council are currently concentrated on uncovering the origin of SCP-7001.





