##228B22|Congratulations,## ##CD5C5C|little miss####228B22|, for you are one of the few children in the world to have stayed in## ##CD5C5C|the Nice List## ##228B22|all year. You cleaned your room everyday and even shared your candy with## ##CD5C5C|your brother.## ##228B22|We are so very proud of you, as are## ##CD5C5C|your parents####228B22|, as they are supposed to.##



##228B22|On the## ##CD5C5C|last day of November####228B22|, you wrote your wish to Santa in the ensuing letter verbatim:##



@@     @@ "i think you could bring me the perfect play date for Christmas like someone from Tv whos nice and good like you. He needs to like to play with my toys and going to tea parties. and he has to love bedtime stories with the ones about princesses and dragons."



##228B22|Unfortunately, Santa is not available this Christmas due to## ##CD5C5C|unanticipated circumstances.## ##228B22|But because we'd hate to see all your hard work going to waste, consider your wish fulfilled,## ##CD5C5C|little miss####228B22|, by Santa's very own helpers.##



[[>]]

