**Dr. SAGAR SINGH, Foundation Daevitologist, Department of Archaeology;**

In **//THE EMPIRE OUTSIDE TIME: A CHRONOLOGICALLY PRECARIOUS STUDY OF ANCIENT DAEVA CULTURE (FOR NOW)//**





