[[span class="st"]]INTERACTION PROTOCOLS:[[/span]] A concise protocol for interaction with the entirety of Nexus-00 is, of course, impossible. In the context of this file's origin and intended indirect implications:



* containment facilities are to be constructed surrounding any known interior bounds of Nexus-00, where feasible;

