**Dr. La Huerta:**  Cristian... please. He is gone... We need to stop...



(//Dr. Juarez takes a syringe and plunges it into Dr. La Huerta's thorat.//)



**Dr. Juárez:** (//Murmuring//) Did I ever tell you he used to take to this very same cinema?



