In 940 CE, the [[span class="hoverlink"]][[[http://scp-int.wikidot.com/yixuehuihub|Abnormality Institute]]][[span class="hoverlink-card"]][[span class="hoverlink-title"]]Abnormality Institute[[/span]][[span class="hoverlink-text" style="font-size:90%;"]]The **Abnormal Objects and Phenomena Institute of China**, founded between 618 CE and 1115 CE, was the largest supernatural research organization in China up until its absorption by the SCP Foundation following the collapse of the Qing Dynasty.[[/span]][[span class="hoverlink-image" style="--src: url(http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/yixuehuihub/yixuehui.jpg)"]]-[[/span]][[/span]][[/span]] //(異學會)// came across the remains of Daevite ruins (p. 3) in the present area of [[span class="censored"]]Hefeng County (和丰县)[[/span]]; on June 15, 940, the Institute established a research settlement focused on investigating the area surrounding the discovery and unlocking the entrance to the structure. A 19-member team was assigned to the settlement to conduct research. Recording their progress on a series of scrolls.



