+++ Log Report 01: Team 53 - Ancient Desert Ruins



-----



[[<]]

[[div class="estrella-paper vintage"]]

**Week 1.-**

———

The arrival was complicated due to the terrain and climate; we are not used to working under the desert sun, and one of us almost died en route from sunstroke. Even so, we managed to set up camp in the area. Even with the weather against us, we have managed to establish the main store and a community store.



We managed to clear three meters of the building's entrance. We have found nothing but more rubble ahead; we will keep digging until we find a chamber. The insects and animals in the area have done nothing to help the team's morale; with all due respect, Sir, the team had doubts about working on this project because of the desert's risks, and now that we are here, many of our fears have been realized, since one night one of the workers was bitten by an insect while we were sleeping. Fortunately, we were able to treat him with medication, but he and several others have refused to continue cooperating unless we are in better conditions.



There are no further complications with the project; however, over the past few days we have felt like we are being watched from the plateau, so we have established a night watch in case of anomalous dangers. But if possible, we ask that you provide us with more sophisticated weapons so that we can defend ourselves against potential threats or locals.



— **//Gāo Xiǎodan//, Expedition leader.**

