We have tried to defend ourselves, but their blood magic has put us at a disadvantage; for my team's safety, we won't keep trying to return to the ruins, but if we stay here under these conditions, our food rations will soon run out. We will try to hold this position for the next few weeks until the supplies we requested arrive. If they run out sooner than expected, we are probably already be on our way to headquarters by the time you read this.



Injured.-

