**Adult Daevite (Female):** [[span class="translation-swap"]][[span class="og-text"]][[span class="daevite"]]Eaṭil[[/span]]! [[span class="daevite"]]iMá aNaxuen eXniteafuefut[[/span]].[[/span]][[span class="tr-text"]]Eṭail! Miá naxaune xentiefaufeut.[[/span]][[/span]]



**Old Daevite (Female):** [[span class="translation-swap"]][[span class="og-text"]][[span class="daevite"]]Suxaru tuhufoieg xutá kut ifáebnefut[[/span]].[[/span]][[span class="tr-text"]]Suxrau tuhufoige xutá kut fiábenfeut.[[/span]][[/span]]



