[The oldest silences the others. After they have spoken among themselves for a while, somewhat dismayed by her, they respond.]



**Adult Daevite (Male):** [[span class="translation-swap"]][[span class="og-text"]][[span class="daevite"]]Xutá iHzá Xuetameg Xuex[[/span]].[[/span]][[span class="tr-text"]]Xutá hizá xutemage xuxe.[[/span]][[/span]]



