**Adult Daevite (Male):** [[span class="translation-swap"]][[span class="og-text"]][[span class="daevite"]]aMešaz[[/span]], [[span class="daevite"]]Xuitḳáeg iMá iHeheftláekt[[/span]].[[/span]][[span class="tr-text"]]Mašeza, xutiḳáge miá hihefetláket.[[/span]][[/span]]



**Me:** Thank you! Thank you... Thank you so much. We'll be there in a moment.

