[[div class="blockquote" style="background: #96182b; color: #fff; padding-bottom: 0.25em"]]

[[<]]

**LOCATION:** Cafeteria/Breakroom, Area-77.

**MEMBERS:**

• Director Káenti Xofiṭaiṭ | //Research and Containment Area-77//

• Researcher Hinḳieli Guangli | //Department of History, Division of Anthropology//

